      "height": 200,
      "text": "# Double Jump\n\n- **Description**: Allows the player to jump again while in mid-air.\n- **Use Case**: Platformers, Action games.\n- **Difficulty**: Easy\n\n## Implementation Notes\n- Track jump count\n- Allow second jump only when airborne\n- Optional: different jump height\n\n## References\n- [Ori Double Jump](https://www.orithegame.com)\n- [Shovel Knight Guide](https://yachtclubgames.com)",
